{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43334","headline":"云夜听猨吟 · 顾伟","name":"云夜听猨吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒岩飞暮雪，绝壁夜猨吟。\n历历和羣雁，寥寥思客心。\n绕枝犹避箭，过岭却投林。\n风冷声偏苦，山寒响更深。\n听时无有定，静里固难寻。\n一宿扶桑月，聊看怀好音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾伟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}